{
  "an4.159:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 4.159 ",
  "an4.159:0.2": "16. Faculties ",
  "an4.159:0.3": "Nun ",
  "an4.159:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "an4.159:1.2": "At one time Venerable Ānanda was staying near Kosambī in Ghosita’s monastery. ",
  "an4.159:1.3": "And then a certain nun addressed a man, ",
  "an4.159:1.4": "“Please, my friend, go to the venerable Ānanda, and in my name bow with your head to his feet. Say to him: ",
  "an4.159:1.5": "‘Sir, the nun named so-and-so is sick, suffering, and gravely ill. ",
  "an4.159:1.6": "She bows with her head to your feet.’ And then say: ",
  "an4.159:1.7": "‘Sir, please go to the nuns’ quarters to visit that nun out of sympathy.’” ",
  "an4.159:1.8": "“Yes, ma’am,” that man replied. He did as the nun asked. ",
  "an4.159:2.1": "",
  "an4.159:2.2": "",
  "an4.159:2.3": "",
  "an4.159:2.4": "Ānanda consented with silence. ",
  "an4.159:3.1": "Then Ānanda robed up and went to the nuns’ quarters to visit that nun, taking his bowl and robe. ",
  "an4.159:3.2": "That nun saw Ānanda coming off in the distance. ",
  "an4.159:3.3": "She wrapped herself up from head to foot and laid down on her cot. ",
  "an4.159:3.4": "Then Venerable Ānanda went up to her, and sat down on the seat spread out. Then Ānanda said to the nun: ",
  "an4.159:4.1": "“Sister, this body is produced by food. Relying on food, ",
  "an4.159:4.2": "you should give up food. ",
  "an4.159:4.3": "This body is produced by craving. Relying on craving, ",
  "an4.159:4.4": "